    "detailed_description": "<strong>Tanklike</strong> will put up to four players through the unforgiving gauntlet of tank on tank action. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302550/extras/60d729c04d24f55e992eaead450932ae.avif?t=1593712814\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302550/extras/8ef59daffcc85fe8c6f925152abaabd6.poster.avif?t=1593712814\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302550/extras/8ef59daffcc85fe8c6f925152abaabd6.webm?t=1593712814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302550/extras/8ef59daffcc85fe8c6f925152abaabd6.mp4?t=1593712814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Ricochet shots</strong> to maximize uplikes as you careen your tank delicately through over a hundred arenas. With victory comes the opportunity to <strong>upgrade stats</strong> or <strong>improve your arsenal</strong> with new abilities. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302550/extras/21ad7fc45af9c00ad5a21e6040aebd61.avif?t=1593712814\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302550/extras/d7e399a6ca3046171f2fb8bf5c6c861d.poster.avif?t=1593712814\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302550/extras/d7e399a6ca3046171f2fb8bf5c6c861d.webm?t=1593712814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302550/extras/d7e399a6ca3046171f2fb8bf5c6c861d.mp4?t=1593712814\" type=\"video/mp4\">